abstract: "Seventh v1.0 release candidate of memoria.ia, dedicated to stabilization of the RC6 semantic-relational runtime: regression hardening, provenance and contamination barriers, server/runtime parity, deterministic context budgeting and ranking, persistence/restart equivalence, semantic non-amplification, and release metadata consistency. No new runtime capability is introduced by RC7."
